# Pytest live-eval dumps (large; one new timestamped JSON per run).
# Already-tracked runs stay tracked so teammates can pull them.
# To share a new run: git add -f services/ai/tests/agent_core/live_eval_logs/<file>.json
**/live_eval_logs/*.json
**/live_eval_logs/check.py

# Complex-planning eval output at the repo root -- reachable directly from the
# project directory, but the transcripts carry a student's grades and course
# history, so they stay out of git by default. Share one explicitly with
# `git add -f agent_planning_eval/<file>`.
/agent_planning_eval/

